<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Triquint Semi started.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Triquint Semi started.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-05-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Smith Barney initiated coverage of Triquint Semiconductor Inc with a neutral rating, a Smith Barney source said.</p>
<p>-- Additional details were not immediately available.</p>
<p>-- Triquint gained 1/2 to 39 in morning trading.</p>
</text>
